      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "Delivery",
      "items": [
        "Pushes to application main trigger conditional image builds. Manual runs can select a source ref.",
        "CI publishes images to ACR and directly commits image references to configuration Git. Debezium has its own digest update workflow.",
        "A configuration-only change enters at Configuration Git. Argo CD reads main and reconciles the root Application."
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "amber",
      "title": "Root Application",
      "items": [
